GIMP Palette
Name: Walk Culture key palette
Columns: 3
#
# Draw every recolourable sprite with ONLY these colours.
# Each ramp runs dark -> mid -> light, so Aseprite's Shading ink steps along it.
# The app swaps the key ramps (skin, hair, primary, secondary, accent) for the
# chosen palette. Outline and the fixed colours are never swapped.
#
  0   0   1	Outline (fixed)
189 134 101	Skin dark
215 159 125	Skin mid
246 211 159	Skin light
 74  44  32	Hair dark
111  68  48	Hair mid
154 100  67	Hair light
122  30  44	Primary dark
185  48  63	Primary mid
226  96 107	Primary light
 30  60 120	Secondary dark
 47  97 183	Secondary mid
 94 143 225	Secondary light
135  87  15	Accent dark
200 138  29	Accent mid
241 189  78	Accent light
255 255 255	White (fixed: eyes, teeth, shine)
138 146 156	Metal dark (fixed)
196 202 209	Metal light (fixed)
